%%{init: {'theme': 'default'}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([External user signed in]) --> Settings[Open own account settings]
    Settings --> Toggle{Enable multi-firm access?}
    Toggle -->|No| Disabled[Set multi_firm_user to false]
    Disabled --> KeepLinks[Keep existing link rows]
    KeepLinks --> Hidden[Hide Linked accounts navigation]
    Toggle -->|Yes| Enabled[Set multi_firm_user to true]
    Enabled --> ShowTab[Show Linked accounts navigation]
    ShowTab --> OpenPage[Open Linked accounts page]
    OpenPage --> EnabledCheck{Current account enabled?}
    EnabledCheck -->|No| ReturnSettings[Redirect to account settings]
    EnabledCheck -->|Yes| ListLinks[Show direct linked accounts]
    ListLinks --> Choice{Manage links}
    Choice -->|Link account| Credentials[Enter other CCCD account email and legacy password]
    Credentials --> Lookup[Normalize email and find CCCD user]
    Lookup --> CredentialCheck{Credentials authenticate?}
    CredentialCheck -->|No| GenericError[Show generic email or password error]
    CredentialCheck -->|Yes| ValidateLink[Validate provider and account relationship]
    ValidateLink --> LinkValid{Link is allowed?}
    LinkValid -->|No| ValidationError[Show link validation errors]
    LinkValid -->|Yes| CreateLink[Create one multi_firm_user_links row]
    CreateLink --> ListLinks
    Choice -->|Remove account| ScopedDelete[Find link through current user's own links]
    ScopedDelete --> DeleteLink[Delete only that link row]
    DeleteLink --> ListLinks
    GenericError --> Credentials
    ValidationError --> Credentials

    Note1[Separate CCCD users and providers remain unchanged]
    Note2[Links are direct; linked accounts cannot own or chain links]
    CreateLink -.-> Note1
    ValidateLink -.-> Note2
